      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"친구 코드를 입력해 주세요\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{font-family:'Gowun Dodum',sans-serif;font-size:16px;padding:12px;background:#fff8e8;border:2px solid #b6a084;border-radius:4px;width:280px;color:#34312c}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9b70bc;outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "사이드바 메뉴",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "왼쪽 서랍장 사이드바의 세로 칸.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-side\"><a class=\"ds-nav is-active\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f6d7b4\" stroke=\"#705b46\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"><path d=\"M4 10l8-6 8 6v10H4z\"/></svg>로비</a><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#9ab0bc\" stroke=\"#637d8b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"5\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\"/></svg>기록</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-side{width:145px;background:#e4d3bc;border:3px solid #484138;padding:20px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-height:102px;border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;font-family:'Gowun Dodum',sans-serif;font-size:17px;color:#24231f;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s}.ds-nav:hover{background:#c3c1a7}.ds-nav.is-active{background:#aeb29a;border-color:#979e89;box-shadow:inset 3px 3px #c9ccb5,inset -3px -3px #a2a88f}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9b70bc;outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
